                                        <div class="properties-description">
                                            <div class="main-title-2">
                                                <h1><span>Description</span></h1>
                                            </div>
                                            <p>
                                                Hotel de Papae in Islamabad is the perfect place to stay when looking for a relaxing and comfortable experience. The standard double room offers plenty of space and all the amenities you need for an enjoyable stay. The hotel in Islamabad is close to various attractions, making it easy to explore the city. And with a wide range of hotel booking options, you can be sure to find the perfect room for your needs. If you're checking out a luxurious suite or a simple space for two, Hotel de Papae has what you're looking for. So why not book your stay today?
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="contact" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="contact-tab">
